@prefix skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#> .
@prefix dcterms: <http://purl.org/dc/terms/> .

<https://www.glossarist.org/dpp/dataset/dpp/concept/dpp-0135>
  a skos:Concept ;
  skos:notation "dpp-0135" ;
  skos:prefLabel "dormant identifier"@eng ;
  skos:definition "identifier recorded at the finest available granularity for an object class for which no passport regime yet exists, held as issuance evidence for adoption by a future regime"@eng ;
  skos:scopeNote "When a future regime issues passports for the object class it adopts the recorded dormant identifiers rather than minting new ones, so that the installed base connects retroactively through its build records."@eng ;
  skos:scopeNote "Inputs are recorded even when no passport exists behind them yet; minting fresh identifiers would orphan the installed base."@eng
 .